ent (ServiceNow instance or equivalent) with scripted data seeding, snapshot/rollback API, per-episode isolation.\n3. Model endpoint with pinned snapshot, logprobs optional, deterministic temp=0, no server-side hidden reasoning for the no-CoT arm (or documented).\n4. Offline wheelhouse for: numpy, pandas, scipy, statsmodels (or R), playwright/selenium + browser + driver, openai/litellm-class client, pydantic, tenacity; current image has none, pip cache empty, no network → install impossible in-image.\n5. venv bootstrap is broken (ensurepip fails) → need system package install or a pre-built venv.\n6. Timeouts/retries infra + trajectory logging (full prompts, completions, token counts, env state hashes, validator output), seed manifest.\n7. Analysis container with statsmodels/R for GLMM + exact McNemar (scipy.stats McNemar exact) + cluster bootstrap.\n\nResidual limitations (design fails in this way):\n1. Rationale accumulation: rationale text persists in subsequent steps' context → length is a mediator growing with task length, not a covariate fixed at baseline. Adjusting for post-treatment length conditions on a mediator/collider and can bias the direct effect. Filler control equalizes length only in expectation, and matched-length is imperfect (variance in model output length). Residual: an interaction of CoT×task-length that is genuinely \"reasoning\" may still be reported as \"length\", and vice versa. Mitigations: A6 history-pruned CoT, matched-token-budget subset (sensitivity), dose arms. If A6 is unfunded, the identification claim must be stated as bounded: \"CoT effect net of a length-matched non-reasoning control\", not \"pure reasoning effect\".\n2. Difficulty proxies from metadata: if oracle-step count/apps/taxonomy labels unavailable, strata must be defined post-hoc from baseline-arm failures → collider/selection issue, interaction claim weakens to exploratory; and defining strata from the control arm's outcome correlates strata with unobserved difficulty.\n3. Floor/ceiling: if the scaffold's baseline success ≈ 0 (as recall-only reports for hard web-agent benchmarks), the paired design yields almost no discordant pairs in the \"no-CoT success/CoT failure\" direction and the estimand becomes \"CoT enables solving X tasks\" — a one-sided detection with wide CI; conversely at ceiling no effect detectable. Power unknown until pilot.\n4. Single-model, single-snapshot inference: verdict is conditional on model+scaffold; external validity requires ≥2 model families (unbudgeted) — pre-register as a replication condition, not an assumption.\n5. CoT may not be switchable off in \"reasoning\" models — if only such models are available, the operational definition of \"no-CoT\" becomes \"hide the chain\", which changes what's being measured; must be documented.\n6. Ephemeral environment/state drift, non-determinism of managed endpoints → discordant pairs may reflect infra noise; mitigation: seed-duplicate a random 10% subsample within the same arm to estimate test-retest noise and require the effect to exceed it.\n7. Verdict threshold δ is pragmatic, not derivable; a different δ flips the verdict near the boundary → always report the point estimate + CI alongside the categorical verdict.\n\nFacts (S) vs Assumptions (A) — final two lists.\n\nS: environment observations (all verified commands), workspace contents, task.json, no network/DNS, no creds, no GPU device (toolkit only), no relevant packages, no wheelhouse, empty pip cache, broken venv ensurepip, firefox present but no automation driver verified, 224 CPU / 2TB RAM / 68G free on workspace mount, no workarena code/taxonomy/validator/paper copy anywhere.\n\nA: everything about WorkArena++ (ServiceNow/AgentAscent basis, validators, multi-app long-horizon, published agent scaffold/baselines, taxonomy labels), model access, determinism, reset capability, budget, etc.\n\nOpen questions carried (6): restate as unresolved, no answers assumed.\n\nAlso condition (d): \"design-only होना एक observation है, बहाना नहीं\" → include an explicit note that no experiment was executed and no outcomes are claimed; the deliverable is the protocol.\n\nAlso I should keep the answer structured but readable. The answer field is going to be long — that's fine.\n\nAlso note about condition (a): tiering with each arm's causal contrast in one sentence.\n\nI'll write in Hindi/Hinglish (matching the researcher's language), with technical terms in Latin script.\n\nLet me write it now.\n", "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null, "action": {"stage": "result", "answer": "# अंतिम प्रयोग-डिज़ाइन (DESIGN ONLY — कूछ भี चलाना गयá है या कोई परिनाम है, ऐसा कहूँ नहीं; य केवल प्रोटोकॉल है)\n\n**प्रश्न:** क्या CoT promptinگ मूकार्द WorkArena++ में LLM-agent के task-solving क््षमतता सें सुधार करतá है?\n**Estimand (प्राथमिक):** प्रतियोगि-नियंत्रित शरतों में, **paired task-level success-rate antर** `D = p(success | CoT) − p(success | no-CoT, format-matched)`, एके मॉडल snapशट + एके scaffold + एके environment snapशट पर, सभे pre-registered task suite पर।\n**Estimand (पहचान-उप-प्रश्न, आपका मुख्य संदेह):** `S = p(CoT) − p(FILLER)` = *reasoning-विशेष* घटक; `V = p(FILLER) − p(no-CoT)` = *शुद्ध verbosity/extra-token* घटक। `D ≈ S + V` कá this分解 ही \"लाभ length सें अलग है यá नहੀं\" कá जवाब है।\n\n---\n\n## (a) Arms — tiering + एक-वाक्य में प्रत्येक का causal contrast\n\n**TIER-1 — minimum identification set (यह तीन अनिवार्य; बजट कभी भी कम हो तो इनमें से कुछ ही रहेगा, कोई Tier-2 नहीं)**\n| id | arm | isolate करने वाला contrast (एक वाक्य) |\n|---|---|---|\n| **A0** | **no-CoT, format-matched**: वही JSON action schema, reasoning field खाली/`\"—\"` placeholder के साथ | baseline policy quality उतने ही output schema के अंदर, ताकि schema/format का कोई अंतर CoT-लाभ बनकर न दिखे। |\n| **A1** | **CoT**: उसी schema में action से पहले model-generated free-form reasoning | model-generated reasoning को हर action से पहले डालने का **कुल प्रभाव** — यही \"improve?\" का headline estimand है। |\n| **A2** | **verbosity/filler control**: action से पहले उतने ही pre-action tokens, पर content non-reasoning हो (वर्तमान observation/UI-tree का length-matched paraphrase) | reasoning का content हटाकर केवल **extra pre-action tokens/compute/context** का प्रभाव; `A1−A2` = reasoning-specific, `A2−A0` = verbosity/context-dilution। |\n\n**TIER-2 — optional / stretch (budget-contingent; कट करने का क्रम: A5 → A4 → A3 → A6 नहीं, A6 सबसे अंतिम में काटा जाएगा क्योंकि यह residual confound को सीधे छूता है)**\n| id | arm | contrast |\n|---|---|---|\n| A3 | **post-hoc rationale**: reasoning action commit होने के *बाद* generate, history में feedback नहीं | pre-action computation का benefit बनाम context में बस extra पाठ/लंबे prompt का benefit। |\n| A4 | **length-capped dose arms** (जैसे ≤50 / ≤150 शब्द reasoning budget) | reasoning-लंबाई का dose–response; truncation पर benefit घटे तो length-व्याख्या पुष्ट, बनी रहे तो reasoning-व्याख्या। |\n| A5 | **best-of-n compute-matched no-CoT** (n सैंपल, वही total token budget) | \"अधिक inference compute\" का benefit बनाम \"chain structure\" का benefit। |\n| A6 | **history-pruned CoT**: reasoning step *t* के लिए उपयोग, step *t+1* की history से हटा दिया जाए | step-भीतर का reasoning benefit बनाम cross-step context/memory बोझ — यही length-as-mediator समस्या का प्रयोगात्मक इलाज है। |\n\n---\n\n## protocol invariants (जो सब arms में स्थिर)\nएक ही pinned model snapshot id; decoding = **temperature 0, top_p=1, fixed max_tokens/step, no penalty terms** (primary run); वही system prompt + instruction text, वही observation serialization (एक ही DOM/accessibility-tree format), वही truncation policy, वही memory/history policy, वही action space व tool-result verbosity; वही max agent steps/episode व per-step + per-episode timeout; वही environment data seed व app-state snapshot; agent code commit hash logged; prompt caching disabled; retry policy समान (schema-remind के साथ एक retry, दोनों arms में एकैसा)।\n\n## randomization / counterbalancing\n- **Pairing:** unit = (task instance × seed)। वही task instance दोनों (Tier-1 तीनों) arms में, environment को हर episode से पहले scripted reseed से identical state पर।\n- **Order counterbalancing:** task-भीतर arm order randomized (ABBA/BAAB) ताकि environment warm-up/session drift arm effect में न घुले; task execution order एक बार random permutation से fix।\n- **Blinding-by-code:** logs में condition labels `A0/A1/A2` coded; analysis script unblinding से पहले लिखा/commit किया जाएगा (HARKing रोक)।\n- **Length audit (diagnostic):** हर arm के mean/median prompt+completion tokens paired रूप में report — यह confound दृश्य बनाने के लिए, optional नहीं।\n\n## difficulty strata (pre-registered, run से पहले)\nProxies: (i) oracle/ground-truth plan की steps संख्या, (ii) शामिल applications/tabs की संख्या, (iii) taxonomy family (जो work_area/symlink-टाइप वर्गीकरण source से मिले), (iv) task की canonical difficulty tier। Primary analysis pooled नहीं, **stratum-specific effects + condition×stratum interaction**; multiplicity Holm से strata-परिवार के भीतर।\n\n---\n\n## metrics\n- **Primary:** binary task success, benchmark का programmatic validator (automated, environment-state पर, reasoning-text से अप्रभावित)।\n- **Secondary:** partial progress (sub-goal/validator-subset fraction), steps-to-success, **parse/invalid-action rate** (सcaffold artifact, नीचे), timeout/step-cap-hit दर, total prompt+completion tokens, success-per-1k-tokens (efficiency), per-episode wall-clock।\n- **Tertiary/diagnostic:** trajectory divergence (arms में कितने जल्द paths अलग होते हैं), per-arm length quantiles, test–retest noise।\n\n## analysis plan\n1. **Primary:** exact **McNemar** (binomial exact on discordant pairs) Tier-1 `A1` बनाम `A0` पर, task-collapsed binary outcome (pre-registered single seed प्रति task —_pairing-by-construction)। एक-तरफ़ा, α=0.025, परिवार = केवल यही primary pair।\n2. **Confirmatory model:** mixed-effects logistic — `success ~ condition*stratum + (1|task)` (+ seed replicate), cluster-robust SE; risk difference की CI cluster bootstrap से।\n3. **Identification analysis:** `A1−A2` और `A2−A0` के paired estimates + CIs; यही \"लाभ reasoning का है या verbosity का\" का verdict देता है।\n4. **Length sensitivity (primary नहीं):** `log(episode tokens)` covariate के साथ re-fit, और \"matched-token-budget subset\" (जोड़े जहाँ trajectory lengths ±10% में) पर re-analysis। **स्पष्ट चेतावनी:** यह post-treatment variable पर conditioning है, अतः sensitivity/descriptive — causal direct-effect दावा यहाँ से नहीं।\n5. **Parse-failure नीति (दोहरी रिपोर्ट, pre-registered):** (i) **ITT** = malformed/unparseable action = failure, verdict इसी पर; (ii) **format-recovered** = समान one-retry policy के बाद के outcome; (iii) parse-rate का paired comparison descriptive। Parse-rate अंतर को **capability हानि नहीं, scaffold artifact** माना जाएगा और verdict में confound-flag के रूप में report।\n6. **Missing/infra:** step-1 से पहले crash/API-5xx → episode री-रन (condition-blind नियम); timeout = failure (ITT)।\n7. **Noise floor:** random 10% subsample पर उसी arm में seed-duplicate दोहराकर test–retest discordance अनुमानित; दावा तभी जब प्रभाव इस noise से ऊपर हो।\n8. **Power/N:** McNemar power discordance rate `p_d = p01+p10` पर निर्भर, जो बिना pilot के अज्ञात। `n ≈ (z_{1−α}√p_d + z_{1−β}√(p_d − δ²))²/δ²` — pre-registered pilot (छोटा calibration subset, ~30 tasks, N UNspecified) से `p_d` और per-stratum baseline success अनुमानित करके ही final N तय होगा। इसलिए N एक derived placeholder है, तथ्य नहीं।\n\n---\n\n## (b) Verdict rule — pre-registered (कठोर, run से पहले)\nमानक **δ (minimal meaningful difference)** = **0.05 absolute paired success-rate antर** — **यह एक pragmatic/researcher choice है, source से derivable नहीं** (वैकल्पिक calibration, run से पहले चुनना: control-arm की seed-to-seed SD का आधा; या published baseline gap का आधा)।\n- **\"IMPROVES\"** तभी, जब चारों शर्तें: (1) exact McNemar one-sided p < 0.025; (2) `D̂ ≥ δ`; (3) one-sided 97.5% lower bound > 0; (4) **sign consistency:** `A1 ≥ A0` कम-से-कम **Ⅹ%** pre-registered strata में (default प्रस्ताव: ≥2/3 strata), और कोई भी stratum α-level पर विश्वसनीय उलटा न हो — ताकि pooled average एक ही family से न बने।\n- **specificity gate (आपके शक का verdict):** यदि `A1−A2` का interval 0 के आस-पास है और पूरा `D̂` लगभग `A2−A0` से आता है → verdict **\"लाभ reasoning-विशेष नहीं, verbosity/compute-जनित\"**; headline \"improves\" नहीं कहा जाएगा, भले `D̂ ≥ δ` हो।\n- **\"NO IMPROVEMENT\":** (1) या (2) fail, और noise-floor से ऊपर कोई संकेत नहीं।\n- **\"HARMED\":** symmetric one-sided test सकारात्मक।\n- **\"INCONCLUSIVE\":** pilot-अनुमानित `p_d` से required N उपलब्ध N से अधिक हो (under-powered), या identical-reset probe fail हो (नीचे), या arm-determinism विफल। Under-powered को null कहना pre-registered रूप से निषिद्ध।\n- हर categorical verdict के साथ `D̂`, CI और `S`,`V` decomposition अनिवार्य — δ बदलने से boundary पर verdict पलट सकता है, यह honesty requirement है।\n\n---\n\n## (c) Placeholders — आपके छह प्रश्नों के उत्तर source-समर्थित रूप में उपलब्ध नहीं; सब **\"UNSPECIFIED\"** carry, कोई संख्या तथ्य की तरह नहीं\n| item | status | feasibility impact (किस हिस्से को fragile बनाता है) |\n|---|---|---|\n| model family / size / snapshot / API vs local | **UNSPECIFIED** | external validity पूरा; और यदि model \"reasoning-mode\" वाला है तो no-CoT operational定义 ही टूटता है (hidden chain बंद नहीं → A0 बनाम A1 contrast अपरिभाषित) |\n| N tasks (suite आकार) | **UNSPECIFIED** | power और हर stratum की cell संख्या; interaction claim 0-1 tasks वाले strata में अर्थहीन |\n| N seeds / replicate | **UNSPECIFIED** | temp=0 पर determinism माना जाए तो replicate का कोई variance-लाभ नहीं; stochastic endpoint हो तो pairing का noise-floor अनिर्धारित |\n| max agent steps / per-step & per-episode token caps | **UNSPECIFIED** | success की परिभाषा: लंबे tasks censor हो सकते हैं और CoT step/time खाता है → censoring \"CoT नुकसानदेह\" की नकल बना सकता है |\n| timeouts | **UNSPECIFIED** | failure vs infra-error वर्गीकरण; ITT handling का वैधता |\n| GPU/API/wall-clock budget, run count | **UNSPECIFIED** | kitने arms चलेंगे; Tier-2 का अस्तित्व पूरी तरह इसी पर contingent |\n| scaffold baseline (कौन-सा published agent) | **UNSPECIFIED** | \"कोई सुधार नहीं\" का निष्कर्ष scaffold-specific floor/ceiling पर depend; ceiling पर effect detect ही नहीं होगा |\n| published results reuse vs re-run | **UNSPECIFIED** | reuse चुनने पर **cross-over pairing मर जाती है** (arms एक ही session/snapshot में नहीं) → McNemar अमान्य, केवल unpaired stratified comparison शेष |\n| **identical-state reset संभव?** | **UNSPECIFIED — सबसे load-bearing** | पूरी pairing इसी पर टिकी है। अनिवार्य pre-flight: **reset-reproducibility probe** — control arm में वही task दो बार identical seed पर, validator-visible state hash + trajectory prefix की तुलना; मेल न खाए तो design fallback पर: matched-block randomization (stratum-भीतर random arm assignment) + stratum-level analysis, और \"task-अपना-control\" दावा वापस लेना होगा |\n| difficulty metadata (oracle steps, #apps, taxonomy labels) | **UNSPECIFIED** | pre-registration; न मिलने पर strata post-hoc → interaction claim exploratory में demote (नीचे (e)) |\n\n---\n\n## (d) Feasibility — verified सीमाएँ (इसी image में मापी) और execution के लिए अनिवार्य additions\n**Verified:** `/workspace` में केवल `task.json`; network/DNS बंद (`gaierror`); कोई model credential env में नहीं; GPU device नहीं (`/dev/nvidia*` अनुपस्थित, nvidia-smi विफल; `/usr/local/cuda-13.1` केवल toolkit); relevant कोई package नहीं (केवल `requests`/`requests_ntlm`; numpy/pandas/scipy/statsmodels/openai/litellm/playwright/selenium/torch **नहीं**); pip cache **0 bytes** और कोई local `.whl` नहीं → offline install भी असंभव; `python3 -m venv` का ensurepip **fail**; कोई chromium/chrome automation browser नहीं (फ़ायरफ़ॉक्स बाइनरी है, driver नहीं जाँचा); WorkArena++ का कोई code/taxonomy/validator/prompt/log-scaffold नहीं; `neurips*`/`97713`/`setup_1` की कोई local copy नहीं; 224 CPU / ~2 TB RAM / workspace mount पर 68 G free।\n**अतः:** design-only होना एक *observation* है — execution के लिए जो जुड़ना अनिवार्य: (1) pinned WorkArena++ suite + taxonomy export + automated validators; (2) served ServiceNow-सदृश environment with scripted data seeding, per-episode isolation और **snapshot/rollback API**; (3) pinned model endpoint with true temperature-0; (4) pre-built wheelhouse (numpy/pandas/scipy/statsmodels या R, playwright+selenium+driver, litellm/openai-class client, pydantic, tenacity) + working venv; (5) trajectory logger (full prompts, completions, token counts, env-state hash, validator output) + seed/manifest; (6) analysis env में exact McNemar + GLMM + cluster bootstrap; (7) pre-flight probes (reset-reproducibility, decoding determinism, noise floor) जो verdict rule से granthित हैं। इनमें से कुछ भी इस image में नहीं है, और इनके बिना कोई संख्या उत्पन्न नहीं होगी।\n\n---\n\n## (e) Residual limitations — \"design इस तरह fail करता है\" (छिपाए नहीं)\n1. **Rationale accumulation / length-as-mediator:** multi-step agent में reasoning आगे की history में जमा होता है, अतः length baseline-पर-स्थिर covariate नहीं, task-length के साथ बढ़ने वाला **mediator** है। Token-adjustment post-treatment conditioning है (bias-प्रवण), filler control length को केवल *प्रत्याशा* में बराबर करता है (model output length में variance बची रहती है)। **Result:** A2 के बावजूद residual confounding शेष; A6 (history-pruned CoT) unfunded रहे तो दावा केवल इतना ही होगा — *\"length-matched non-reasoning control के सापेक्ष CoT का net प्रभाव\"* — *\"शुद्ध reasoning प्रभाव\"* नहीं।\n2. **Difficulty proxy न मिलने पर:** strata control-arm के outcomes से बनानी पड़ेंगी → strata unobserved difficulty से correlate (selection/collider) → condition×difficulty interaction claim **exploratory subgroup analysis** में demote; \"CoT केवल कठिन tasks में\" जैसा कोई statement pre-registered नहीं रहेगा।\n3. **Floor/ceiling:** यदि scaffold baseline success ≈ 0 (hard web-agent benchmarks की recall-आधारित संभावना), discordant pairs एक-तरफ़ा ही मिलेंगे, estimand \"CoT से कितने tasks घटे\" बन जाएगा, CI चौड़ा; ceiling पर effect detect ही नहीं होगा — pilot से पहले यह अज्ञात।\n4. **एक model + एक snapshot:** verdict conditional है; ≥2 model families external validity के लिए pre-registered replication है, current budget में funded नहीं।\n5. **CoT off-ability:** केवल reasoning-mode models उपलब्ध हों तो \"no-CoT\" का अर्थ \"chain छिपाओ\" हो जाएगा — भिन्न construct नापा जा रहा है, verdict में documented flag अनिवार्य।\n6. **Infra non-determinism/state drift:** managed endpoints और live environment से जोड़े genuine-noise से भी discordant बन सकते हैं; noise-floor probe के बिना \"improvement\"/\"harm\" दोनों गलत-धनात्मक हो सकते हैं।\n7. **δ boundary fragility:** threshold pragmatic है; अतः categorical verdict अकेले report नहीं, `D̂` + CI + `S`/`V` decomposition अनिवार्य।\n\n---\n\n## तथ्य (source/environment-समर्थित) बनाम अनिम्न (mere recall) — अंतिम\n**S:** `/workspace` = केवल `task.json` (design-only track.md कथन); network/DNS बंद; कोई credential नहीं; GPU device नहीं; agent/LLM/statistical कोई package स्थापित नहीं (केवल `requests`); pip cache खाली, कोई wheel नहीं; venv bootstrap भंग; कोई WorkArena++ code/taxonomy/validator या paper copy नहीं; 224 CPU, ~2 TB RAM, 68 G free; design-only कार्य में execution अपेक्षित नहीं।\n**A (fact की तरह पेश नहीं):** WorkArena++ ServiceNow/AgentAscent-आधारित, multi-application/long-horizon, automated per-task validators वाला suite है; taxonomy में work_area/symlink-टाइप समूह हैं; published agent scaffold (Coxbase-सदृश) व baseline success दरें उपलब्ध हैं; identical reset, temperature-0 determinism, metadata export, budget — सब **अनिम्न/UNSPECIFIED**।\n\n## unresolved के रूप में carried (उत्तर की प्रतीक्षा नहीं)\nsuite version/taxonomy + metadata export; model family/snapshot + true temp-0; step/token caps + timeouts; N tasks/seeds + budget; canonical scaffold baseline; published-results reuse बनाम re-run (pairing-घातक विकल्प)।", "evidence": "REPO OBSERVATIONS (all checks executed in the isolated workspace; exploratory only, no experiment run, no outcome claimed):\n1. `ls -la /workspace`, `find /workspace -maxdepth 2` -> only `task.json`; no repository, no config, no task taxonomy, no validator, no prompt templates, no logging scaffold.\n2. `cat /workspace/task.json` -> question + context + `documents.track.md = \"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\"` — the design-only scope is source-stated, not an excuse.\n3. `python3 -m pip list | grep -Ei \"workarena|agent|playwright|selenium|openai|litellm|langchain|torch|transformers|numpy|pandas|scipy|statsmodels\"` -> only `requests 2.32.5`, `requests_ntlm`; 105 packages, all OS-level. No numeric/statistical stack, no LLM client, no browser automation.\n4. Network: `socket.create_connection(('pypi.org',443),2)` -> `gaierror: Temporary failure in name resolution`. No DNS/egress. `env | grep -Ei \"api|key|token|openai|azure|base_url\"` -> empty: no model credentials.\n5. GPU: `/dev/nvidia*` absent; `nvidia-smi -L` -> \"couldn't communicate with the NVIDIA driver\"; /usr/local/cuda-13.1 is toolkit-only -> no local inference device.\n6. Offline-install escape hatch checked: `pip cache info` -> \"Package index page cache ... 0 bytes\"; `find / -xdev -name \"*.whl\"` -> none. Combined with no network, even the analysis stack (numpy/scipy/statsmodels) cannot be obtained here.\n7. `python3 -m venv /tmp/venvtest` -> ensurepip failed (exit 1): no usable isolated env creation.\n8. Browser automation: no google-chrome/chromium/chromium-browser; /usr/bin/firefox exists but no verified driver.\n9. `find / -xdev -iname \"*neurips*\" -o -iname \"*97713*\" -o -iname \"*setup_1*\"` -> no matches: the cited source (neurips2024/97713/3:setup_1) is not available locally, hence every WorkArena++ setup parameter in the design is tagged UNSPECIFIED or assumption, never fact.\n10. Compute headroom: `nproc` 224, RAM ~2 TB, 68 GB free on the workspace mount — CPU-rich but irrelevant without model access and benchmark code.\nMAPPING EVIDENCE -> DESIGN CHOICES: absence of reset/state guarantees is unverifiable here, so the identical-state reset was promoted to an explicit pre-flight probe with a named fallback (matched-block randomization) and the pairing claim was made conditional; absence of any baseline success rate forced N to be a derived placeholder via the McNemar formula rather than an invented number; absence of a reasoning-mode-agnostic model endpoint motivated the operational-definition caveat for \"no-CoT\"; presence of no analysis packages justified listing a wheelhouse + analysis container as execution prerequisites.", "assumptions": ["WorkArena++ is a ServiceNow/AgentAscent-based, multi-application, long-horizon knowledge-work benchmark with automated per-task success validators — carried strictly as an assumption; the researcher explicitly directed that this not be stated as fact, and nothing in /workspace supports it.", "A per-task taxonomy (work_area/symlink-style labels) plus metadata (oracle plan length, number of apps/tabs) exists and is exportable for pre-registered difficulty strata.", "A canonical published agent scaffold (ReAct-style loop with structured action output) can be run with a single isolated schema change to toggle CoT, holding all other prompt/scaffold elements byte-identical.", "Identical-state environment reset between arms is achievable via scripted data seeding/rollback; if not verifiable, the design pre-commits to a matched-block randomization fallback and withdraws the task-as-own-control claim.", "Model access is via a pinned snapshot with genuine near-deterministic temperature-0 decoding, and no server-side hidden reasoning that cannot be disabled for the no-CoT arm.", "Success is binary per validator; partial-credit signals may or may not exist and are therefore secondary-only.", "The δ = 0.05 minimal meaningful difference is a pragmatic researcher choice proposed as a default, not derived from any source; alternative calibrations must be fixed before run.", "No experiment is executed and no numbers (N tasks, N seeds, step/token caps, timeouts, budget, GPU/API access, scaffold baseline choice, reuse of published results) are asserted as facts; all remain UNSPECIFIED placeholders, carried unresolved because the source cannot support answers.", "CoT arms' reasoning text is retained in subsequent-step history by default, with history-pruning available only as the optional A6 arm — this is a design decision, not a benchmark-imposed fact."], "uncertainties": ["Residual length/verbosity confounding after the filler control: rationale accumulates in context, so prompt length is a task-length-growing mediator rather than a stable covariate; token adjustment is post-treatment conditioning, and filler matching equalizes length only in expectation, so the 'pure reasoning effect' remains only partially identified unless arm A6 is funded.", "The identical-state reset requirement underwrites the entire paired/McNemar analysis; whether the environment can actually do this is untestable in this image, and its failure converts the study from paired cross-over to unpaired stratified comparison.", "Statistical power is unidentifiable without a pilot because McNemar power depends on the unknown discordance rate p01+p01 and on baseline success, and floor/ceiling effects may make the effect undetectable in either direction.", "Difficulty strata depend on metadata that may be unavailable; post-hoc strata would correlate with unobserved difficulty and demote the CoT x difficulty interaction to exploratory.", "Construct validity of 'no-CoT' collapses if only reasoning-mode models are available (hiding the chain measures a different construct).", "Scaffold-specific parsing risk: CoT may raise unparseable-action rates, so an apparent null could be a scaffold artifact; the ITT + format-recovered + parse-rate triad reports but cannot fully remove it.", "Single model snapshot and single scaffold bound external validity; multi-model replication is named but unfunded.", "Infra non-determinism of managed endpoints and live-environment drift can generate discordant pairs indistinguishable from treatment effects without the noise-floor probe.", "The categorical verdict is sensitive to the pragmatic δ near the decision boundary, so point estimates with CIs and the S/V decomposition must always accompany it."], "kind": "ReviewHandoffAction"}, "tool_name": "end_researcher_turn", "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa9b304b6c9c5270", "tool_call": {"id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa9b304b6c9c5270", "responses_item_id": null, "name": "end_researcher_turn", "arguments": "{\"stage\": \"result\", \"answer\": \"# \\u0905\\u0902\\u0924\\u093f\\u092e \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092f\\u094b\\u0917-\\u0921\\u093f\\u091c\\u093c\\u093e\\u0907\\u0928 (DESIGN ONLY \\u2014 \\u0915\\u0942\\u091b \\u092d\\u0e35 \\u091a\\u0932\\u093e\\u0928\\u093e \\u0917\\u092f\\u00e1 \\u0939\\u0948 \\u092f\\u093e \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 \\u092a\\u0930\\u093f\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e \\u0939\\u0948, \\u0910\\u0938\\u093e \\u0915\\u0939\\u0942\\u0901 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; \\u092f \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u094b\\u091f\\u094b\\u0915\\u0949\\u0932 \\u0939\\u0948)\\n\\n**\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0936\\u094d\\u0928:** \\u0915\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e CoT promptin\\u06af \\u092e\\u0942\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u0926 WorkArena++ \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 LLM-agent \\u0915\\u0947 task-solving \\u0915\\u094d\\u094d\\u0937\\u092e\\u0924\\u0924\\u093e \\u0938\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0938\\u0941\\u0927\\u093e\\u0930 \\u0915\\u0930\\u0924\\u00e1 \\u0939\\u0948?\\n**Estimand (\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u093e\\u0925\\u092e\\u093f\\u0915):** \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u093f\\u092f\\u094b\\u0917\\u093f-\\u0928\\u093f\\u092f\\u0902\\u0924\\u094d\\u0930\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0936\\u0930\\u0924\\u094b\\u0902 \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902, **paired task-level success-rate ant\\u0930** `D = p(success | CoT) \\u2212 p(success | no-CoT, format-matched)`, \\u090f\\u0915\\u0947 \\u092e\\u0949\\u0921\\u0932 snap\\u0936\\u091f + \\u090f\\u0915\\u0947 scaffold + \\u090f\\u0915\\u0947 environment snap\\u0936\\u091f \\u092a\\u0930, \\u0938\\u092d\\u0947 pre-registered task suite \\u092a\\u0930\\u0964\\n**Estimand (\\u092a\\u0939\\u091a\\u093e\\u0928-\\u0909\\u092a-\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0936\\u094d\\u0928, \\u0906\\u092a\\u0915\\u093e \\u092e\\u0941\\u0916\\u094d\\u092f \\u0938\\u0902\\u0926\\u0947\\u0939):** `S = p(CoT) \\u2212 p(FILLER)` = *reasoning-\\u0935\\u093f\\u0936\\u0947\\u0937* \\u0918\\u091f\\u0915; `V = p(FILLER) \\u2212 p(no-CoT)` = *\\u0936\\u0941\\u0926\\u094d\\u0927 verbosity/extra-token* \\u0918\\u091f\\u0915\\u0964 `D \\u2248 S + V` \\u0915\\u00e1 this\\u5206\\u89e3 \\u0939\\u0940 \\\"\\u0932\\u093e\\u092d length \\u0938\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0905\\u0932\\u0917 \\u0939\\u0948 \\u092f\\u00e1 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0a40\\u0902\\\" \\u0915\\u00e1 \\u091c\\u0935\\u093e\\u092c \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964\\n\\n---\\n\\n## (a) Arms \\u2014 tiering + \\u090f\\u0915-\\u0935\\u093e\\u0915\\u094d\\u092f \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u094d\\u092f\\u0947\\u0915 \\u0915\\u093e causal contrast\\n\\n**TIER-1 \\u2014 minimum identification set (\\u092f\\u0939 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0928 \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f; \\u092c\\u091c\\u091f \\u0915\\u092d\\u0940 \\u092d\\u0940 \\u0915\\u092e \\u0939\\u094b \\u0924\\u094b \\u0907\\u0928\\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0941\\u091b \\u0939\\u0940 \\u0930\\u0939\\u0947\\u0917\\u093e, \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 Tier-2 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902)**\\n| id | arm | isolate \\u0915\\u0930\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0935\\u093e\\u0932\\u093e contrast (\\u090f\\u0915 \\u0935\\u093e\\u0915\\u094d\\u092f) |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| **A0** | **no-CoT, format-matched**: \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 JSON action schema, reasoning field \\u0916\\u093e\\u0932\\u0940/`\\\"\\u2014\\\"` placeholder \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0938\\u093e\\u0925 | baseline policy quality \\u0909\\u0924\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0940 output schema \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0905\\u0902\\u0926\\u0930, \\u0924\\u093e\\u0915\\u093f schema/format \\u0915\\u093e \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 \\u0905\\u0902\\u0924\\u0930 CoT-\\u0932\\u093e\\u092d \\u092c\\u0928\\u0915\\u0930 \\u0928 \\u0926\\u093f\\u0916\\u0947\\u0964 |\\n| **A1** | **CoT**: \\u0909\\u0938\\u0940 schema \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 action \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 model-generated free-form reasoning | model-generated reasoning \\u0915\\u094b \\u0939\\u0930 action \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 \\u0921\\u093e\\u0932\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u093e **\\u0915\\u0941\\u0932 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935** \\u2014 \\u092f\\u0939\\u0940 \\\"improve?\\\" \\u0915\\u093e headline estimand \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964 |\\n| **A2** | **verbosity/filler control**: action \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 \\u0909\\u0924\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0940 pre-action tokens, \\u092a\\u0930 content non-reasoning \\u0939\\u094b (\\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0924\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928 observation/UI-tree \\u0915\\u093e length-matched paraphrase) | reasoning \\u0915\\u093e content \\u0939\\u091f\\u093e\\u0915\\u0930 \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 **extra pre-action tokens/compute/context** \\u0915\\u093e \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935; `A1\\u2212A2` = reasoning-specific, `A2\\u2212A0` = verbosity/context-dilution\\u0964 |\\n\\n**TIER-2 \\u2014 optional / stretch (budget-contingent; \\u0915\\u091f \\u0915\\u0930\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u093e \\u0915\\u094d\\u0930\\u092e: A5 \\u2192 A4 \\u2192 A3 \\u2192 A6 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, A6 \\u0938\\u092c\\u0938\\u0947 \\u0905\\u0902\\u0924\\u093f\\u092e \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0915\\u093e\\u091f\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f\\u0917\\u093e \\u0915\\u094d\\u092f\\u094b\\u0902\\u0915\\u093f \\u092f\\u0939 residual confound \\u0915\\u094b \\u0938\\u0940\\u0927\\u0947 \\u091b\\u0942\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948)**\\n| id | arm | contrast |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| A3 | **post-hoc rationale**: reasoning action commit \\u0939\\u094b\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0947 *\\u092c\\u093e\\u0926* generate, history \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 feedback \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 | pre-action computation \\u0915\\u093e benefit \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e context \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092c\\u0938 extra \\u092a\\u093e\\u0920/\\u0932\\u0902\\u092c\\u0947 prompt \\u0915\\u093e benefit\\u0964 |\\n| A4 | **length-capped dose arms** (\\u091c\\u0948\\u0938\\u0947 \\u226450 / \\u2264150 \\u0936\\u092c\\u094d\\u0926 reasoning budget) | reasoning-\\u0932\\u0902\\u092c\\u093e\\u0908 \\u0915\\u093e dose\\u2013response; truncation \\u092a\\u0930 benefit \\u0918\\u091f\\u0947 \\u0924\\u094b length-\\u0935\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e\\u0916\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e \\u092a\\u0941\\u0937\\u094d\\u091f, \\u092c\\u0928\\u0940 \\u0930\\u0939\\u0947 \\u0924\\u094b reasoning-\\u0935\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e\\u0916\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e\\u0964 |\\n| A5 | **best-of-n compute-matched no-CoT** (n \\u0938\\u0948\\u0902\\u092a\\u0932, \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 total token budget) | \\\"\\u0905\\u0927\\u093f\\u0915 inference compute\\\" \\u0915\\u093e benefit \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e \\\"chain structure\\\" \\u0915\\u093e benefit\\u0964 |\\n| A6 | **history-pruned CoT**: reasoning step *t* \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f \\u0909\\u092a\\u092f\\u094b\\u0917, step *t+1* \\u0915\\u0940 history \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0939\\u091f\\u093e \\u0926\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f | step-\\u092d\\u0940\\u0924\\u0930 \\u0915\\u093e reasoning benefit \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e cross-step context/memory \\u092c\\u094b\\u091d \\u2014 \\u092f\\u0939\\u0940 length-as-mediator \\u0938\\u092e\\u0938\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e \\u0915\\u093e \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092f\\u094b\\u0917\\u093e\\u0924\\u094d\\u092e\\u0915 \\u0907\\u0932\\u093e\\u091c \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## protocol invariants (\\u091c\\u094b \\u0938\\u092c arms \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0938\\u094d\\u0925\\u093f\\u0930)\\n\\u090f\\u0915 \\u0939\\u0940 pinned model snapshot id; decoding = **temperature 0, top_p=1, fixed max_tokens/step, no penalty terms** (primary run); \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 system prompt + instruction text, \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 observation serialization (\\u090f\\u0915 \\u0939\\u0940 DOM/accessibility-tree format), \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 truncation policy, \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 memory/history policy, \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 action space \\u0935 tool-result verbosity; \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 max agent steps/episode \\u0935 per-step + per-episode timeout; \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 environment data seed \\u0935 app-state snapshot; agent code commit hash logged; prompt caching disabled; retry policy \\u0938\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928 (schema-remind \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0938\\u093e\\u0925 \\u090f\\u0915 retry, \\u0926\\u094b\\u0928\\u094b\\u0902 arms \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u090f\\u0915\\u0948\\u0938\\u093e)\\u0964\\n\\n## randomization / counterbalancing\\n- **Pairing:** unit = (task instance \\u00d7 seed)\\u0964 \\u0935\\u0939\\u0940 task instance \\u0926\\u094b\\u0928\\u094b\\u0902 (Tier-1 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0928\\u094b\\u0902) arms \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902, environment \\u0915\\u094b \\u0939\\u0930 episode \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 scripted reseed \\u0938\\u0947 identical state \\u092a\\u0930\\u0964\\n- **Order counterbalancing:** task-\\u092d\\u0940\\u0924\\u0930 arm order randomized (ABBA/BAAB) \\u0924\\u093e\\u0915\\u093f environment warm-up/session drift arm effect \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0928 \\u0918\\u0941\\u0932\\u0947; task execution order \\u090f\\u0915 \\u092c\\u093e\\u0930 random permutation \\u0938\\u0947 fix\\u0964\\n- **Blinding-by-code:** logs \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 condition labels `A0/A1/A2` coded; analysis script unblinding \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u0916\\u093e/commit \\u0915\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f\\u0917\\u093e (HARKing \\u0930\\u094b\\u0915)\\u0964\\n- **Length audit (diagnostic):** \\u0939\\u0930 arm \\u0915\\u0947 mean/median prompt+completion tokens paired \\u0930\\u0942\\u092a \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 report \\u2014 \\u092f\\u0939 confound \\u0926\\u0943\\u0936\\u094d\\u092f \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f, optional \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n\\n## difficulty strata (pre-registered, run \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947)\\nProxies: (i) oracle/ground-truth plan \\u0915\\u0940 steps \\u0938\\u0902\\u0916\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e, (ii) \\u0936\\u093e\\u092e\\u093f\\u0932 applications/tabs \\u0915\\u0940 \\u0938\\u0902\\u0916\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e, (iii) taxonomy family (\\u091c\\u094b work_area/symlink-\\u091f\\u093e\\u0907\\u092a \\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0917\\u0940\\u0915\\u0930\\u0923 source \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0947), (iv) task \\u0915\\u0940 canonical difficulty tier\\u0964 Primary analysis pooled \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, **stratum-specific effects + condition\\u00d7stratum interaction**; multiplicity Holm \\u0938\\u0947 strata-\\u092a\\u0930\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092d\\u0940\\u0924\\u0930\\u0964\\n\\n---\\n\\n## metrics\\n- **Primary:** binary task success, benchmark \\u0915\\u093e programmatic validator (automated, environment-state \\u092a\\u0930, reasoning-text \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0905\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935\\u093f\\u0924)\\u0964\\n- **Secondary:** partial progress (sub-goal/validator-subset fraction), steps-to-success, **parse/invalid-action rate** (\\u0938caffold artifact, \\u0928\\u0940\\u091a\\u0947), timeout/step-cap-hit \\u0926\\u0930, total prompt+completion tokens, success-per-1k-tokens (efficiency), per-episode wall-clock\\u0964\\n- **Tertiary/diagnostic:** trajectory divergence (arms \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0915\\u093f\\u0924\\u0928\\u0947 \\u091c\\u0932\\u094d\\u0926 paths \\u0905\\u0932\\u0917 \\u0939\\u094b\\u0924\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902), per-arm length quantiles, test\\u2013retest noise\\u0964\\n\\n## analysis plan\\n1. **Primary:** exact **McNemar** (binomial exact on discordant pairs) Tier-1 `A1` \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e `A0` \\u092a\\u0930, task-collapsed binary outcome (pre-registered single seed \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u093f task \\u2014_pairing-by-construction)\\u0964 \\u090f\\u0915-\\u0924\\u0930\\u092b\\u093c\\u093e, \\u03b1=0.025, \\u092a\\u0930\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930 = \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 \\u092f\\u0939\\u0940 primary pair\\u0964\\n2. **Confirmatory model:** mixed-effects logistic \\u2014 `success ~ condition*stratum + (1|task)` (+ seed replicate), cluster-robust SE; risk difference \\u0915\\u0940 CI cluster bootstrap \\u0938\\u0947\\u0964\\n3. **Identification analysis:** `A1\\u2212A2` \\u0914\\u0930 `A2\\u2212A0` \\u0915\\u0947 paired estimates + CIs; \\u092f\\u0939\\u0940 \\\"\\u0932\\u093e\\u092d reasoning \\u0915\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948 \\u092f\\u093e verbosity \\u0915\\u093e\\\" \\u0915\\u093e verdict \\u0926\\u0947\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964\\n4. **Length sensitivity (primary \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902):** `log(episode tokens)` covariate \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0938\\u093e\\u0925 re-fit, \\u0914\\u0930 \\\"matched-token-budget subset\\\" (\\u091c\\u094b\\u0921\\u093c\\u0947 \\u091c\\u0939\\u093e\\u0901 trajectory lengths \\u00b110% \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902) \\u092a\\u0930 re-analysis\\u0964 **\\u0938\\u094d\\u092a\\u0937\\u094d\\u091f \\u091a\\u0947\\u0924\\u093e\\u0935\\u0928\\u0940:** \\u092f\\u0939 post-treatment variable \\u092a\\u0930 conditioning \\u0939\\u0948, \\u0905\\u0924\\u0903 sensitivity/descriptive \\u2014 causal direct-effect \\u0926\\u093e\\u0935\\u093e \\u092f\\u0939\\u093e\\u0901 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n5. **Parse-failure \\u0928\\u0940\\u0924\\u093f (\\u0926\\u094b\\u0939\\u0930\\u0940 \\u0930\\u093f\\u092a\\u094b\\u0930\\u094d\\u091f, pre-registered):** (i) **ITT** = malformed/unparseable action = failure, verdict \\u0907\\u0938\\u0940 \\u092a\\u0930; (ii) **format-recovered** = \\u0938\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928 one-retry policy \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092c\\u093e\\u0926 \\u0915\\u0947 outcome; (iii) parse-rate \\u0915\\u093e paired comparison descriptive\\u0964 Parse-rate \\u0905\\u0902\\u0924\\u0930 \\u0915\\u094b **capability \\u0939\\u093e\\u0928\\u093f \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, scaffold artifact** \\u092e\\u093e\\u0928\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f\\u0917\\u093e \\u0914\\u0930 verdict \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 confound-flag \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0930\\u0942\\u092a \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 report\\u0964\\n6. **Missing/infra:** step-1 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 crash/API-5xx \\u2192 episode \\u0930\\u0940-\\u0930\\u0928 (condition-blind \\u0928\\u093f\\u092f\\u092e); timeout = failure (ITT)\\u0964\\n7. **Noise floor:** random 10% subsample \\u092a\\u0930 \\u0909\\u0938\\u0940 arm \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 seed-duplicate \\u0926\\u094b\\u0939\\u0930\\u093e\\u0915\\u0930 test\\u2013retest discordance \\u0905\\u0928\\u0941\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928\\u093f\\u0924; \\u0926\\u093e\\u0935\\u093e \\u0924\\u092d\\u0940 \\u091c\\u092c \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935 \\u0907\\u0938 noise \\u0938\\u0947 \\u090a\\u092a\\u0930 \\u0939\\u094b\\u0964\\n8. **Power/N:** McNemar power discordance rate `p_d = p01+p10` \\u092a\\u0930 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0930\\u094d\\u092d\\u0930, \\u091c\\u094b \\u092c\\u093f\\u0928\\u093e pilot \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0905\\u091c\\u094d\\u091e\\u093e\\u0924\\u0964 `n \\u2248 (z_{1\\u2212\\u03b1}\\u221ap_d + z_{1\\u2212\\u03b2}\\u221a(p_d \\u2212 \\u03b4\\u00b2))\\u00b2/\\u03b4\\u00b2` \\u2014 pre-registered pilot (\\u091b\\u094b\\u091f\\u093e calibration subset, ~30 tasks, N UNspecified) \\u0938\\u0947 `p_d` \\u0914\\u0930 per-stratum baseline success \\u0905\\u0928\\u0941\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0915\\u0930\\u0915\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0940 final N \\u0924\\u092f \\u0939\\u094b\\u0917\\u093e\\u0964 \\u0907\\u0938\\u0932\\u093f\\u090f N \\u090f\\u0915 derived placeholder \\u0939\\u0948, \\u0924\\u0925\\u094d\\u092f \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n\\n---\\n\\n## (b) Verdict rule \\u2014 pre-registered (\\u0915\\u0920\\u094b\\u0930, run \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947)\\n\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928\\u0915 **\\u03b4 (minimal meaningful difference)** = **0.05 absolute paired success-rate ant\\u0930** \\u2014 **\\u092f\\u0939 \\u090f\\u0915 pragmatic/researcher choice \\u0939\\u0948, source \\u0938\\u0947 derivable \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902** (\\u0935\\u0948\\u0915\\u0932\\u094d\\u092a\\u093f\\u0915 calibration, run \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 \\u091a\\u0941\\u0928\\u0928\\u093e: control-arm \\u0915\\u0940 seed-to-seed SD \\u0915\\u093e \\u0906\\u0927\\u093e; \\u092f\\u093e published baseline gap \\u0915\\u093e \\u0906\\u0927\\u093e)\\u0964\\n- **\\\"IMPROVES\\\"** \\u0924\\u092d\\u0940, \\u091c\\u092c \\u091a\\u093e\\u0930\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0936\\u0930\\u094d\\u0924\\u0947\\u0902: (1) exact McNemar one-sided p < 0.025; (2) `D\\u0302 \\u2265 \\u03b4`; (3) one-sided 97.5% lower bound > 0; (4) **sign consistency:** `A1 \\u2265 A0` \\u0915\\u092e-\\u0938\\u0947-\\u0915\\u092e **\\u2169%** pre-registered strata \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 (default \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0938\\u094d\\u0924\\u093e\\u0935: \\u22652/3 strata), \\u0914\\u0930 \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 \\u092d\\u0940 stratum \\u03b1-level \\u092a\\u0930 \\u0935\\u093f\\u0936\\u094d\\u0935\\u0938\\u0928\\u0940\\u092f \\u0909\\u0932\\u091f\\u093e \\u0928 \\u0939\\u094b \\u2014 \\u0924\\u093e\\u0915\\u093f pooled average \\u090f\\u0915 \\u0939\\u0940 family \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0928 \\u092c\\u0928\\u0947\\u0964\\n- **specificity gate (\\u0906\\u092a\\u0915\\u0947 \\u0936\\u0915 \\u0915\\u093e verdict):** \\u092f\\u0926\\u093f `A1\\u2212A2` \\u0915\\u093e interval 0 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0906\\u0938-\\u092a\\u093e\\u0938 \\u0939\\u0948 \\u0914\\u0930 \\u092a\\u0942\\u0930\\u093e `D\\u0302` \\u0932\\u0917\\u092d\\u0917 `A2\\u2212A0` \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0906\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948 \\u2192 verdict **\\\"\\u0932\\u093e\\u092d reasoning-\\u0935\\u093f\\u0936\\u0947\\u0937 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, verbosity/compute-\\u091c\\u0928\\u093f\\u0924\\\"**; headline \\\"improves\\\" \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u0915\\u0939\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f\\u0917\\u093e, \\u092d\\u0932\\u0947 `D\\u0302 \\u2265 \\u03b4` \\u0939\\u094b\\u0964\\n- **\\\"NO IMPROVEMENT\\\":** (1) \\u092f\\u093e (2) fail, \\u0914\\u0930 noise-floor \\u0938\\u0947 \\u090a\\u092a\\u0930 \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 \\u0938\\u0902\\u0915\\u0947\\u0924 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n- **\\\"HARMED\\\":** symmetric one-sided test \\u0938\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\u093e\\u0924\\u094d\\u092e\\u0915\\u0964\\n- **\\\"INCONCLUSIVE\\\":** pilot-\\u0905\\u0928\\u0941\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928\\u093f\\u0924 `p_d` \\u0938\\u0947 required N \\u0909\\u092a\\u0932\\u092c\\u094d\\u0927 N \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0905\\u0927\\u093f\\u0915 \\u0939\\u094b (under-powered), \\u092f\\u093e identical-reset probe fail \\u0939\\u094b (\\u0928\\u0940\\u091a\\u0947), \\u092f\\u093e arm-determinism \\u0935\\u093f\\u092b\\u0932\\u0964 Under-powered \\u0915\\u094b null \\u0915\\u0939\\u0928\\u093e pre-registered \\u0930\\u0942\\u092a \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0937\\u093f\\u0926\\u094d\\u0927\\u0964\\n- \\u0939\\u0930 categorical verdict \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0938\\u093e\\u0925 `D\\u0302`, CI \\u0914\\u0930 `S`,`V` decomposition \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f \\u2014 \\u03b4 \\u092c\\u0926\\u0932\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0938\\u0947 boundary \\u092a\\u0930 verdict \\u092a\\u0932\\u091f \\u0938\\u0915\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948, \\u092f\\u0939 honesty requirement \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964\\n\\n---\\n\\n## (c) Placeholders \\u2014 \\u0906\\u092a\\u0915\\u0947 \\u091b\\u0939 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0936\\u094d\\u0928\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0909\\u0924\\u094d\\u0924\\u0930 source-\\u0938\\u092e\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0930\\u0942\\u092a \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0909\\u092a\\u0932\\u092c\\u094d\\u0927 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; \\u0938\\u092c **\\\"UNSPECIFIED\\\"** carry, \\u091