nment) + stratum-level analysis, \\u0914\\u0930 \\\"task-\\u0905\\u092a\\u0928\\u093e-control\\\" \\u0926\\u093e\\u0935\\u093e \\u0935\\u093e\\u092a\\u0938 \\u0932\\u0947\\u0928\\u093e \\u0939\\u094b\\u0917\\u093e |\\n| difficulty metadata (oracle steps, #apps, taxonomy labels) | **UNSPECIFIED** | pre-registration; \\u0928 \\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0928\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0930 strata post-hoc \\u2192 interaction claim exploratory \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 demote (\\u0928\\u0940\\u091a\\u0947 (e)) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## (d) Feasibility \\u2014 verified \\u0938\\u0940\\u092e\\u093e\\u090f\\u0901 (\\u0907\\u0938\\u0940 image \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092e\\u093e\\u092a\\u0940) \\u0914\\u0930 execution \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f additions\\n**Verified:** `/workspace` \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 `task.json`; network/DNS \\u092c\\u0902\\u0926 (`gaierror`); \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 model credential env \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; GPU device \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 (`/dev/nvidia*` \\u0905\\u0928\\u0941\\u092a\\u0938\\u094d\\u0925\\u093f\\u0924, nvidia-smi \\u0935\\u093f\\u092b\\u0932; `/usr/local/cuda-13.1` \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 toolkit); relevant \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 package \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 (\\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 `requests`/`requests_ntlm`; numpy/pandas/scipy/statsmodels/openai/litellm/playwright/selenium/torch **\\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902**); pip cache **0 bytes** \\u0914\\u0930 \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 local `.whl` \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u2192 offline install \\u092d\\u0940 \\u0905\\u0938\\u0902\\u092d\\u0935; `python3 -m venv` \\u0915\\u093e ensurepip **fail**; \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 chromium/chrome automation browser \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 (\\u092b\\u093c\\u093e\\u092f\\u0930\\u092b\\u093c\\u0949\\u0915\\u094d\\u0938 \\u092c\\u093e\\u0907\\u0928\\u0930\\u0940 \\u0939\\u0948, driver \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u091c\\u093e\\u0901\\u091a\\u093e); WorkArena++ \\u0915\\u093e \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 code/taxonomy/validator/prompt/log-scaffold \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; `neurips*`/`97713`/`setup_1` \\u0915\\u0940 \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 local copy \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; 224 CPU / ~2 TB RAM / workspace mount \\u092a\\u0930 68 G free\\u0964\\n**\\u0905\\u0924\\u0903:** design-only \\u0939\\u094b\\u0928\\u093e \\u090f\\u0915 *observation* \\u0939\\u0948 \\u2014 execution \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f \\u091c\\u094b \\u091c\\u0941\\u0921\\u093c\\u0928\\u093e \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f: (1) pinned WorkArena++ suite + taxonomy export + automated validators; (2) served ServiceNow-\\u0938\\u0926\\u0943\\u0936 environment with scripted data seeding, per-episode isolation \\u0914\\u0930 **snapshot/rollback API**; (3) pinned model endpoint with true temperature-0; (4) pre-built wheelhouse (numpy/pandas/scipy/statsmodels \\u092f\\u093e R, playwright+selenium+driver, litellm/openai-class client, pydantic, tenacity) + working venv; (5) trajectory logger (full prompts, completions, token counts, env-state hash, validator output) + seed/manifest; (6) analysis env \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 exact McNemar + GLMM + cluster bootstrap; (7) pre-flight probes (reset-reproducibility, decoding determinism, noise floor) \\u091c\\u094b verdict rule \\u0938\\u0947 granth\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902\\u0964 \\u0907\\u0928\\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0941\\u091b \\u092d\\u0940 \\u0907\\u0938 image \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u0939\\u0948, \\u0914\\u0930 \\u0907\\u0928\\u0915\\u0947 \\u092c\\u093f\\u0928\\u093e \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 \\u0938\\u0902\\u0916\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e \\u0909\\u0924\\u094d\\u092a\\u0928\\u094d\\u0928 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u0939\\u094b\\u0917\\u0940\\u0964\\n\\n---\\n\\n## (e) Residual limitations \\u2014 \\\"design \\u0907\\u0938 \\u0924\\u0930\\u0939 fail \\u0915\\u0930\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948\\\" (\\u091b\\u093f\\u092a\\u093e\\u090f \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902)\\n1. **Rationale accumulation / length-as-mediator:** multi-step agent \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 reasoning \\u0906\\u0917\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0940 history \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u091c\\u092e\\u093e \\u0939\\u094b\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948, \\u0905\\u0924\\u0903 length baseline-\\u092a\\u0930-\\u0938\\u094d\\u0925\\u093f\\u0930 covariate \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, task-length \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0938\\u093e\\u0925 \\u092c\\u0922\\u093c\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0935\\u093e\\u0932\\u093e **mediator** \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964 Token-adjustment post-treatment conditioning \\u0939\\u0948 (bias-\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0935\\u0923), filler control length \\u0915\\u094b \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 *\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e\\u0936\\u093e* \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092c\\u0930\\u093e\\u092c\\u0930 \\u0915\\u0930\\u0924\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948 (model output length \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 variance \\u092c\\u091a\\u0940 \\u0930\\u0939\\u0924\\u0940 \\u0939\\u0948)\\u0964 **Result:** A2 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092c\\u093e\\u0935\\u091c\\u0942\\u0926 residual confounding \\u0936\\u0947\\u0937; A6 (history-pruned CoT) unfunded \\u0930\\u0939\\u0947 \\u0924\\u094b \\u0926\\u093e\\u0935\\u093e \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 \\u0907\\u0924\\u0928\\u093e \\u0939\\u0940 \\u0939\\u094b\\u0917\\u093e \\u2014 *\\\"length-matched non-reasoning control \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0938\\u093e\\u092a\\u0947\\u0915\\u094d\\u0937 CoT \\u0915\\u093e net \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935\\\"* \\u2014 *\\\"\\u0936\\u0941\\u0926\\u094d\\u0927 reasoning \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935\\\"* \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n2. **Difficulty proxy \\u0928 \\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0928\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0930:** strata control-arm \\u0915\\u0947 outcomes \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u0928\\u0940 \\u092a\\u0921\\u093c\\u0947\\u0902\\u0917\\u0940 \\u2192 strata unobserved difficulty \\u0938\\u0947 correlate (selection/collider) \\u2192 condition\\u00d7difficulty interaction claim **exploratory subgroup analysis** \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 demote; \\\"CoT \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 \\u0915\\u0920\\u093f\\u0928 tasks \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902\\\" \\u091c\\u0948\\u0938\\u093e \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 statement pre-registered \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u0930\\u0939\\u0947\\u0917\\u093e\\u0964\\n3. **Floor/ceiling:** \\u092f\\u0926\\u093f scaffold baseline success \\u2248 0 (hard web-agent benchmarks \\u0915\\u0940 recall-\\u0906\\u0927\\u093e\\u0930\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0938\\u0902\\u092d\\u093e\\u0935\\u0928\\u093e), discordant pairs \\u090f\\u0915-\\u0924\\u0930\\u092b\\u093c\\u093e \\u0939\\u0940 \\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0947\\u0902\\u0917\\u0947, estimand \\\"CoT \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0915\\u093f\\u0924\\u0928\\u0947 tasks \\u0918\\u091f\\u0947\\\" \\u092c\\u0928 \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f\\u0917\\u093e, CI \\u091a\\u094c\\u0921\\u093c\\u093e; ceiling \\u092a\\u0930 effect detect \\u0939\\u0940 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 \\u0939\\u094b\\u0917\\u093e \\u2014 pilot \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 \\u092f\\u0939 \\u0905\\u091c\\u094d\\u091e\\u093e\\u0924\\u0964\\n4. **\\u090f\\u0915 model + \\u090f\\u0915 snapshot:** verdict conditional \\u0939\\u0948; \\u22652 model families external validity \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f pre-registered replication \\u0939\\u0948, current budget \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 funded \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n5. **CoT off-ability:** \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 reasoning-mode models \\u0909\\u092a\\u0932\\u092c\\u094d\\u0927 \\u0939\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0924\\u094b \\\"no-CoT\\\" \\u0915\\u093e \\u0905\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925 \\\"chain \\u091b\\u093f\\u092a\\u093e\\u0913\\\" \\u0939\\u094b \\u091c\\u093e\\u090f\\u0917\\u093e \\u2014 \\u092d\\u093f\\u0928\\u094d\\u0928 construct \\u0928\\u093e\\u092a\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e \\u0930\\u0939\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948, verdict \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 documented flag \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f\\u0964\\n6. **Infra non-determinism/state drift:** managed endpoints \\u0914\\u0930 live environment \\u0938\\u0947 \\u091c\\u094b\\u0921\\u093c\\u0947 genuine-noise \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092d\\u0940 discordant \\u092c\\u0928 \\u0938\\u0915\\u0924\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902; noise-floor probe \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092c\\u093f\\u0928\\u093e \\\"improvement\\\"/\\\"harm\\\" \\u0926\\u094b\\u0928\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0917\\u0932\\u0924-\\u0927\\u0928\\u093e\\u0924\\u094d\\u092e\\u0915 \\u0939\\u094b \\u0938\\u0915\\u0924\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902\\u0964\\n7. **\\u03b4 boundary fragility:** threshold pragmatic \\u0939\\u0948; \\u0905\\u0924\\u0903 categorical verdict \\u0905\\u0915\\u0947\\u0932\\u0947 report \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, `D\\u0302` + CI + `S`/`V` decomposition \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u0935\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f\\u0964\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \\u0924\\u0925\\u094d\\u092f (source/environment-\\u0938\\u092e\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925\\u093f\\u0924) \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e \\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u092e\\u094d\\u0928 (mere recall) \\u2014 \\u0905\\u0902\\u0924\\u093f\\u092e\\n**S:** `/workspace` = \\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 `task.json` (design-only track.md \\u0915\\u0925\\u0928); network/DNS \\u092c\\u0902\\u0926; \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 credential \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; GPU device \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; agent/LLM/statistical \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 package \\u0938\\u094d\\u0925\\u093e\\u092a\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902 (\\u0915\\u0947\\u0935\\u0932 `requests`); pip cache \\u0916\\u093e\\u0932\\u0940, \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 wheel \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; venv bootstrap \\u092d\\u0902\\u0917; \\u0915\\u094b\\u0908 WorkArena++ code/taxonomy/validator \\u092f\\u093e paper copy \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902; 224 CPU, ~2 TB RAM, 68 G free; design-only \\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 execution \\u0905\\u092a\\u0947\\u0915\\u094d\\u0937\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902\\u0964\\n**A (fact \\u0915\\u0940 \\u0924\\u0930\\u0939 \\u092a\\u0947\\u0936 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902):** WorkArena++ ServiceNow/AgentAscent-\\u0906\\u0927\\u093e\\u0930\\u093f\\u0924, multi-application/long-horizon, automated per-task validators \\u0935\\u093e\\u0932\\u093e suite \\u0939\\u0948; taxonomy \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 work_area/symlink-\\u091f\\u093e\\u0907\\u092a \\u0938\\u092e\\u0942\\u0939 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902; published agent scaffold (Coxbase-\\u0938\\u0926\\u0943\\u0936) \\u0935 baseline success \\u0926\\u0930\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0909\\u092a\\u0932\\u092c\\u094d\\u0927 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902; identical reset, temperature-0 determinism, metadata export, budget \\u2014 \\u0938\\u092c **\\u0905\\u0928\\u093f\\u092e\\u094d\\u0928/UNSPECIFIED**\\u0964\\n\\n## unresolved \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0930\\u0942\\u092a \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 carried (\\u0909\\u0924\\u094d\\u0924\\u0930 \\u0915\\u0940 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u0940\\u0915\\u094d\\u0937\\u093e \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902)\\nsuite version/taxonomy + metadata export; model family/snapshot + true temp-0; step/token caps + timeouts; N tasks/seeds + budget; canonical scaffold baseline; published-results reuse \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u092e re-run (pairing-\\u0918\\u093e\\u0924\\u0915 \\u0935\\u093f\\u0915\\u0932\\u094d\\u092a)\\u0964\", \"evidence\": \"REPO OBSERVATIONS (all checks executed in the isolated workspace; exploratory only, no experiment run, no outcome claimed):\\n1. `ls -la /workspace`, `find /workspace -maxdepth 2` -> only `task.json`; no repository, no config, no task taxonomy, no validator, no prompt templates, no logging scaffold.\\n2. `cat /workspace/task.json` -> question + context + `documents.track.md = \\\"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\\\"` \\u2014 the design-only scope is source-stated, not an excuse.\\n3. `python3 -m pip list | grep -Ei \\\"workarena|agent|playwright|selenium|openai|litellm|langchain|torch|transformers|numpy|pandas|scipy|statsmodels\\\"` -> only `requests 2.32.5`, `requests_ntlm`; 105 packages, all OS-level. No numeric/statistical stack, no LLM client, no browser automation.\\n4. Network: `socket.create_connection(('pypi.org',443),2)` -> `gaierror: Temporary failure in name resolution`. No DNS/egress. `env | grep -Ei \\\"api|key|token|openai|azure|base_url\\\"` -> empty: no model credentials.\\n5. GPU: `/dev/nvidia*` absent; `nvidia-smi -L` -> \\\"couldn't communicate with the NVIDIA driver\\\"; /usr/local/cuda-13.1 is toolkit-only -> no local inference device.\\n6. Offline-install escape hatch checked: `pip cache info` -> \\\"Package index page cache ... 0 bytes\\\"; `find / -xdev -name \\\"*.whl\\\"` -> none. Combined with no network, even the analysis stack (numpy/scipy/statsmodels) cannot be obtained here.\\n7. `python3 -m venv /tmp/venvtest` -> ensurepip failed (exit 1): no usable isolated env creation.\\n8. Browser automation: no google-chrome/chromium/chromium-browser; /usr/bin/firefox exists but no verified driver.\\n9. `find / -xdev -iname \\\"*neurips*\\\" -o -iname \\\"*97713*\\\" -o -iname \\\"*setup_1*\\\"` -> no matches: the cited source (neurips2024/97713/3:setup_1) is not available locally, hence every WorkArena++ setup parameter in the design is tagged UNSPECIFIED or assumption, never fact.\\n10. Compute headroom: `nproc` 224, RAM ~2 TB, 68 GB free on the workspace mount \\u2014 CPU-rich but irrelevant without model access and benchmark code.\\nMAPPING EVIDENCE -> DESIGN CHOICES: absence of reset/state guarantees is unverifiable here, so the identical-state reset was promoted to an explicit pre-flight probe with a named fallback (matched-block randomization) and the pairing claim was made conditional; absence of any baseline success rate forced N to be a derived placeholder via the McNemar formula rather than an invented number; absence of a reasoning-mode-agnostic model endpoint motivated the operational-definition caveat for \\\"no-CoT\\\"; presence of no analysis packages justified listing a wheelhouse + analysis container as execution prerequisites.\", \"assumptions\": [\"WorkArena++ is a ServiceNow/AgentAscent-based, multi-application, long-horizon knowledge-work benchmark with automated per-task success validators \\u2014 carried strictly as an assumption; the researcher explicitly directed that this not be stated as fact, and nothing in /workspace supports it.\", \"A per-task taxonomy (work_area/symlink-style labels) plus metadata (oracle plan length, number of apps/tabs) exists and is exportable for pre-registered difficulty strata.\", \"A canonical published agent scaffold (ReAct-style loop with structured action output) can be run with a single isolated schema change to toggle CoT, holding all other prompt/scaffold elements byte-identical.\", \"Identical-state environment reset between arms is achievable via scripted data seeding/rollback; if not verifiable, the design pre-commits to a matched-block randomization fallback and withdraws the task-as-own-control claim.\", \"Model access is via a pinned snapshot with genuine near-deterministic temperature-0 decoding, and no server-side hidden reasoning that cannot be disabled for the no-CoT arm.\", \"Success is binary per validator; partial-credit signals may or may not exist and are therefore secondary-only.\", \"The \\u03b4 = 0.05 minimal meaningful difference is a pragmatic researcher choice proposed as a default, not derived from any source; alternative calibrations must be fixed before run.\", \"No experiment is executed and no numbers (N tasks, N seeds, step/token caps, timeouts, budget, GPU/API access, scaffold baseline choice, reuse of published results) are asserted as facts; all remain UNSPECIFIED placeholders, carried unresolved because the source cannot support answers.\", \"CoT arms' reasoning text is retained in subsequent-step history by default, with history-pruning available only as the optional A6 arm \\u2014 this is a design decision, not a benchmark-imposed fact.\"], \"uncertainties\": [\"Residual length/verbosity confounding after the filler control: rationale accumulates in context, so prompt length is a task-length-growing mediator rather than a stable covariate; token adjustment is post-treatment conditioning, and filler matching equalizes length only in expectation, so the 'pure reasoning effect' remains only partially identified unless arm A6 is funded.\", \"The identical-state reset requirement underwrites the entire paired/McNemar analysis; whether the environment can actually do this is untestable in this image, and its failure converts the study from paired cross-over to unpaired stratified comparison.\", \"Statistical power is unidentifiable without a pilot because McNemar power depends on the unknown discordance rate p01+p01 and on baseline success, and floor/ceiling effects may make the effect undetectable in either direction.\", \"Difficulty strata depend on metadata that may be unavailable; post-hoc strata would correlate with unobserved difficulty and demote the CoT x difficulty interaction to exploratory.\", \"Construct validity of 'no-CoT' collapses if only reasoning-mode models are available (hiding the chain measures a different construct).\", \"Scaffold-specific parsing risk: CoT may raise unparseable-action rates, so an apparent null could be a scaffold artifact; the ITT + format-recovered + parse-rate triad reports but cannot fully remove it.\", \"Single model snapshot and single scaffold bound external validity; multi-model replication is named but unfunded.\", \"Infra non-determinism of managed endpoints and live-environment drift can generate discordant pairs indistinguishable from treatment effects without the noise-floor probe.\", \"The categorical verdict is sensitive to the pragmatic \\u03b4 near the decision boundary, so point estimates with CIs and the S/V decomposition must always accompany it.\"]}", "kind": "ActionEvent"}
